{"seq":2,"slug":"sample-ratio-mismatch","title":"样本比失衡 (SRM)：实验数据可信度的第一道体检","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-experimentation-ab-testing/measurement/sample-ratio-mismatch","wordCount":1474,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"样本比失衡-srm-实验数据可信度的第一道体检\">样本比失衡 (SRM)：实验数据可信度的第一道体检</h1><p>你设计了一个 50/50 的实验，跑了一周，后台显示对照组 100000 人、实验组 96500 人。3.5% 的差距，看着不大，很多人会当成正常波动放过去。这是前端实验里代价最惨重的误判之一：这个偏差在统计上几乎不可能出于偶然，它是一个警报——你的分流、曝光或数据管道某处坏了，而在修好它之前，<strong>这个实验的所有指标结论都不可信</strong>，哪怕主指标显示 +10% 也不能信。样本比失衡（Sample Ratio Mismatch, SRM）就是这道必须最先做的体检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么一点点偏差就是大问题\">核心概念：为什么一点点偏差就是大问题</h2><p>直觉上「50/50 分流出现 100000 vs 96500 只是运气」是错的。当样本量很大时，随机分配的实际比例会极其紧密地贴合设计比例——偏离几百上千都属正常，但偏离数千则概率低到可以忽略。判定它是否异常，用<strong>卡方拟合优度检验</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = \\sum_{i} \\frac{(O_i - E_i)^2}{E_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7688em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各组的实际观测样本量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按设计比例算出的期望样本量。对两组的情形，自由度为 1。以上面的数字为例，总样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>196500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">196500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">196500</span></span></span></span></span>，期望每组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>98250</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">98250</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">98250</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>98250</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>98250</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>96500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>98250</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>98250</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>62.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = \\frac{(100000-98250)^2}{98250} + \\frac{(96500-98250)^2}{98250} \\approx 62.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">98250</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">98250</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">98250</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">96500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">98250</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">62.3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>自由度 1 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>62.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = 62.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">62.3</span></span></span></span></span> 对应的 p 值远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。业界的经验阈值是 <strong>SRM 的 p 值 &lt; 0.001 就应告警</strong>（<a href=\"https://vwo.com/blog/best-practices-for-ab-testing-in-enterprise/\">微软、Google 等公开的实验平台实践普遍采用这个门槛</a>）。这里 p 值极小，意味着「若分流真是公平的，出现这么大偏差的概率近乎为零」——所以分流一定出了问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[实验产出各组样本量] --&gt; B[按设计比例算期望 E_i]&#10;    B --&gt; C[卡方拟合优度检验]&#10;    C --&gt; D{p 值 &lt; 0.001?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否 无 SRM| E[数据可信&lt;br/&gt;继续分析主指标]&#10;    D --&gt;|是 有 SRM| F[数据不可信&lt;br/&gt;停止解读指标]&#10;    F --&gt; G[排查根因:&lt;br/&gt;分流/曝光/管道/过滤]&#10;    G --&gt; H[修复后重跑实验]\">flowchart TD\n    A[实验产出各组样本量] --&gt; B[按设计比例算期望 E_i]\n    B --&gt; C[卡方拟合优度检验]\n    C --&gt; D{p 值 &lt; 0.001?}\n    D --&gt;|否 无 SRM| E[数据可信&lt;br/&gt;继续分析主指标]\n    D --&gt;|是 有 SRM| F[数据不可信&lt;br/&gt;停止解读指标]\n    F --&gt; G[排查根因:&lt;br/&gt;分流/曝光/管道/过滤]\n    G --&gt; H[修复后重跑实验]</pre><h2 id=\"关键认知-srm-是-不可信-信号-不是-无效-信号\">关键认知：SRM 是「不可信」信号，不是「无效」信号</h2><p>必须澄清一个常见误解：SRM 不是说「实验没效果」，而是说「你不能相信任何效果数字」。有 SRM 的实验里，那些看起来漂亮的提升往往正是偏差本身造成的假象。下表把 SRM 的严重性和普通指标问题区分开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主指标不显著</td>\n<td>可能真无效，或样本不足</td>\n<td>加样本 / 接受无差别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>护栏指标变差</td>\n<td>有隐性伤害</td>\n<td>权衡是否否决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出现 SRM</td>\n<td>数据管道有系统性偏差</td>\n<td>立即停止解读，先修再谈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>换句话说，SRM 检查的优先级高于一切——它是解读任何指标之前的<strong>前置门禁</strong>。一个成熟平台会在每个实验上自动、持续地跑 SRM 检查，一旦触发就把实验标红并阻止下结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"srm-的常见成因-前端视角\">SRM 的常见成因：前端视角</h2><p>SRM 的根因几乎总是「某个环节对两组的处理不对称」。前端实验里高发的几类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>曝光丢失不对称</strong>：这是前端最典型的成因。实验组变体多加载了资源、渲染更慢，导致更多实验组用户在<a href=\"../delivery/exposure-tracking\">曝光事件上报</a>之前就离开，实验组曝光被系统性地少记。慢一点点，就能吃掉几个百分点的样本。</li>\n<li><strong>分桶实现有偏</strong>：哈希函数分布不均、或<a href=\"../delivery/bucketing-assignment\">分桶</a>代码里存在边界错误（比如 <code>&lt;</code> 写成 <code>&lt;=</code>），让某一组稳定多分到一点。</li>\n<li><strong>重定向或加载失败</strong>：某个变体触发了额外跳转，跳转过程中的流失让该组样本缩水。</li>\n<li><strong>机器人/爬虫过滤不对称</strong>：数据清洗规则对两组过滤力度不同。</li>\n<li><strong>分流单元与分析单元不一致</strong>：按设备分流却按用户分析，聚合时产生系统性错配。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[发现 SRM] --&gt; B{偏差在哪个环节出现?}&#10;    B --&gt; C[分配阶段&lt;br/&gt;看原始分桶比例]&#10;    B --&gt; D[曝光阶段&lt;br/&gt;看曝光上报比例]&#10;    B --&gt; E[分析阶段&lt;br/&gt;看过滤后比例]&#10;    C --&gt;|分桶就偏| F[查哈希/边界/salt]&#10;    D --&gt;|分桶正常曝光偏| G[查变体性能/上报可靠性]&#10;    E --&gt;|曝光正常分析偏| H[查过滤规则/join 逻辑]\">flowchart TD\n    A[发现 SRM] --&gt; B{偏差在哪个环节出现?}\n    B --&gt; C[分配阶段&lt;br/&gt;看原始分桶比例]\n    B --&gt; D[曝光阶段&lt;br/&gt;看曝光上报比例]\n    B --&gt; E[分析阶段&lt;br/&gt;看过滤后比例]\n    C --&gt;|分桶就偏| F[查哈希/边界/salt]\n    D --&gt;|分桶正常曝光偏| G[查变体性能/上报可靠性]\n    E --&gt;|曝光正常分析偏| H[查过滤规则/join 逻辑]</pre><p>诊断 SRM 的关键手法是<strong>分环节看比例</strong>：在分配、曝光、过滤后各算一次样本比，看偏差从哪一步开始出现，就能把根因锁定到那一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-srm-检查工程化\">把 SRM 检查工程化</h2><p>SRM 不该是人工偶尔看一眼，而应是流水线里的自动门禁。工程化要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>持续运行</strong>：不是实验结束才查，而是从有数据起就实时监控，越早发现越省成本。</li>\n<li><strong>分维度查</strong>：不仅查整体比例，还按设备类型、地区、渠道等维度分别查——有时整体正常但某个细分（比如某型号手机上变体崩溃）严重失衡，暴露的是变体在特定环境的 bug。</li>\n<li><strong>和 A/A 测试配合</strong>：一个持续跑的 <a href=\"../practice/experiment-qa\">A/A 测试</a>（两组完全相同）如果都出现 SRM，说明是平台底层管道的问题，而非某个具体实验的变体问题。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>前端团队应把「分组曝光量比值」做成一个实时仪表盘，让它成为每个实验健康的第一块表——这比事后发现数据全废、白跑一周要划算得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SRM 是实际分流比例显著偏离设计比例的现象，用卡方拟合优度检验判定，p 值 &lt; 0.001 即告警。</li>\n<li>大样本下随机波动极小，一点点比例偏差在统计上几乎不可能出于偶然，因此 SRM 极其可信地指向系统性缺陷。</li>\n<li>SRM 是「数据不可信」信号而非「实验无效」信号：有 SRM 时所有指标结论作废，必须先修再谈。</li>\n<li>前端最常见成因是曝光丢失不对称（变体更慢→更多人提前离开），其次是分桶边界错误、重定向流失、过滤不对称。</li>\n<li>诊断靠分环节（分配/曝光/过滤）看比例定位根因；工程上应持续、分维度自动监控，并与 A/A 测试配合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>曝光丢失如何制造 SRM：<a href=\"../delivery/exposure-tracking\">曝光追踪</a></li>\n<li>分桶边界错误如何制造 SRM：<a href=\"../delivery/bucketing-assignment\">分桶与分配</a></li>\n<li>用 A/A 测试验证平台无偏：<a href=\"../practice/experiment-qa\">实验质量保障</a></li>\n<li>卡方检验与假设检验的统计基础：<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/hypothesis-testing/testing-fundamentals\">概率统计 — 假设检验基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"样本比失衡 (SRM)：实验数据可信度的第一道体检","id":"样本比失衡-srm-实验数据可信度的第一道体检"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么一点点偏差就是大问题","id":"核心概念-为什么一点点偏差就是大问题"},{"level":2,"text":"关键认知：SRM 是「不可信」信号，不是「无效」信号","id":"关键认知-srm-是-不可信-信号-不是-无效-信号"},{"level":2,"text":"SRM 的常见成因：前端视角","id":"srm-的常见成因-前端视角"},{"level":2,"text":"把 SRM 检查工程化","id":"把-srm-检查工程化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"指标与护栏：设计一个不会自欺的度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-experimentation-ab-testing/measurement/metrics-guardrails"},"next":{"title":"序贯检验：如何合法地「天天盯着实验看」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-experimentation-ab-testing/measurement/sequential-testing"}}